## Cycle 3 — Monetization
- [ ] LB-16: Stripe payment collection at booking confirmation
- [ ] LB-17: Subscription gating (free: 1 service, 20 bookings/mo; Pro: unlimited)
- [ ] LB-18: Custom domain support (CNAME to Firebase Hosting)
- [ ] LB-19: Business analytics page (bookings per week, revenue, top service)
