## Definition of done (Cycle 1)
- Owner can sign in with Google
- Owner can add at least one service with duration and price
- Owner can set available hours for at least one day
- Customer can visit /book/:id and complete a booking
- Booking appears in owner's dashboard
- Firestore security rules prevent unauthorized access
- App builds and deploys to Firebase Hosting without errors
